=== FILE: README.md ===
# Banana Split AI — Nano Banana Prompt Generator

This is a minimal, modular Next.js + Tailwind app built for Vercel. It contains a dashboard of micro-tools (Erase people, Change outfit, etc.), each with an input/output preview and a prompt-template text area that follows the Gemini (Nano Banana) image-generation prompt guidance.

The repo includes:
- `pages/` — Next.js pages (index)
- `components/` — UI components (Dashboard, ToolCard)
- `styles/` — global CSS (Tailwind + defaults)
- `lib/` — DB schema and helper
- `public/` — placeholder images

## Local run
1. `npm install`
2. `npm run dev`
3. Open `http://localhost:3000`

## Deploy to Vercel
1. Create a new Vercel project and link this repo
2. Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_GUIDE=true` (optional flag used internally)
3. Deploy

Note: This app **does not** call any Gemini API — the goal is to produce an *image prompt text* (the "result").

